~ tunnelstart

You and Xiu finally reach the entrance of the tunnel system... without Xiu knowing of your presence, all thanks to your stealthy raccoon prowess.
Xiu pushes open the tunnel door and hops inside. You squeeze yourself into the entrance as quickly as possible so you don’t lose sight of the rat princess!
#neutral xiu expression
Xiu: Hello friend! Why have you been following me? Is something the matter?
Your flabbers have been gastered as you stare in shock at the Rat Princess' high intuition.
#surprised roro expression
Roro: !!! You knew?!
Xiu: Well… I didn’t want to make you feel bad, but yes I did. 
Roro: But, I'm so sneaky!
Xiu: Of course you are! I just have really good hearing! But if it was anyone else they totally would not have heard you at all my friend! 
You feel your heart still at the kindness of her words. You've never felt so heard and acknowledged before!
Roro: This only makes me [i]more[/i] determined to help you!
Xiu: Oh? How are you going to do that, friend?
You take her paws into your paws and fall to your back paws.
Roro: I know… about something… I shouldn’t.
#nervous xiu expression
Her face warps into slight unease, as she waits for your explanation. You feel your heart clench at her concerned expression.
Roro: But- LET ME FINISH. 
Xiu: I am… listening friend. 
Roro: I saw who you met in secret… with the delicious smelling pie.
Xiu: !
Roro: And let me just say, I know this love is pure because I would never share food with anyone!
Xiu: … Well… that is very kind of you to say, friend.
Roro: I support you two!! I've never seen such strong romance blossom, especially in the midst of such a huge war. 
Roro: I know it will be hard for the two of you, but I'm determined to do anything I can to help!
Xiu's tail swayed as she looked away, seemingly embarrassed by your loud proclamations.
#embarrassed xiu expression 
Xiu: That's very sweet, but can we please use our inside voices? 
Roro: Oh! Yeah of course sorry. I got excited. 
Your voice lowered to a conspiratorial whisper.
Roro: Romance just does that to me. 
Xiu gives out a little laugh and her tail sways a little more in embarrassment. 
Xiu: It's okay, I understand. I get like that, too… especially when I am with her.
Her paws hold each other in comfort as she considers your words.
Xiu: To be honest... I am really scared about the future. I don't know how long this can last... I just know that I don't want what I have with her to ever end.
Xiu: If you really mean your words... Then, I would really appreciate your help. 
Roro: OF COURSE!! 
Xiu's ears twitch as she bears a tight smile. You lower your tone in shame. 
Roro: O-Of course. I will help in anyway I can, Xiu.
#neutral xiu expression
Xiu: Ah, you already know my name? Where have my manners been this whole time?
Xiu: Friend, what's your name?
Oh my gosh, Xiu's asking you for your name!!! Be cool!!
Roro: It’s Roro.
Xiu: Roro! What a lovely name.
SHE THINKS YOUR NAME IS LOVELY!!! 
Roro: I will never let you down, Xiu.
Xiu: How very kind of you.
Suddenly, you hear a creak above you. 
Xiu: Hmm. Those pipes, again...
Roro: What's been happening with them?
Xiu: Recently, a lot of my family has been victims of the pipes flooding our home. 
Xiu: So far, it's just been blocking out a lot of our pathways. But, I'm worried that it might escalate.
Xiu: If I lost anyone here... I don't think I would be able to forgive myself for pursuing a silly romance at a time like this. 
Roro: !!! 
Oh no, a threat to your OTP!!! You have to fix this NOW!
#neutral roro expression
Roro: Don’t worry, Xiu. I took a plumbing class at the local community college. You can count on me!
Xiu: Oh, I couldn't possibly ask that of you, Roro!
She used your name!!
Roro: No, I couldn't possibly leave you (and your relationship) in such dire conditions! I [i]will[/i] fix this! I'm the best plumber in New York City!
#happy roro expression
#happy xiu expression
Xiu: Wow, I had no idea! I apologize for underestimating you, Roro. If you really could help, my family and I would be most grateful. 
#nervous roro expression
Roro: (I'm a liar!! I'm a liar and a fraud!! There's no way I can let her down now!! I don’t even know what community college is!!!!)
The pipes give another groan overhead. You might not know a lot about pipes, but anyone could tell that it's about to burst.
Xiu: I think we should depart now. This place isn't exactly the safest. 
Xiu: If you'd like, I could introduce you to my family!
Roro: Woah, what an honor! Lead the way, Xiu!
=> END